{"4209430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CTRLSINK", "steam_appid": 4209430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTRLSINK</strong> is a submerged post-apocalyptic retro-style FPS set after a devastating human/AI war. The world has drowned, the continents swallowed by rising oceans, and the last traces of humanity lie scattered in flooded bunkers and rusted war ruins. Blast through radioactive facilities, fight corrupted machines, and uncover the final secrets left beneath the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the Antarctic ice lies <strong>SUBY</strong> --&gt; an analog submarine fortress buried far below radiation zones, forgotten by the wars above. Inside it rests the last preserved humans, sleeping in cryogenic chambers for <strong>333 years</strong>, untouched by digital influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUBY is fully analog.<br>No uplink. No signal.<br>Only silence --&gt; until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries of isolation, <strong>Protocol CTRL</strong> has begun: the gradual awakening of the crew. Each revived human is immediately bonded to an <strong>Extreme Human Armor Suit</strong>, a relic of the pre-war era --&gt; no AI, purely biological-mechanical and analogical systems.<br>It heals. It strengthens. It protects. Is Controls.<br>It is the only thing keeping humanity alive outside SUBY’s hull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/e393ab0083f15d02ceb17b3b0ca5cdff.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/e393ab0083f15d02ceb17b3b0ca5cdff.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/e393ab0083f15d02ceb17b3b0ca5cdff.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every awakened person becomes a new <strong>Crew Unit</strong>, sent to gather data about the fallen world, discover what truly ended civilization, and search for any land still capable of sustaining life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mission codename: CTRL/SINK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/febfbac41e3e745f956a96250a0d6569.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/febfbac41e3e745f956a96250a0d6569.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/febfbac41e3e745f956a96250a0d6569.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--&gt; CTRL your situation or SINK &lt;--</strong><br>One human at a time.<br>One last chance for the species.<br>If a Crew Unit dies… the next cryo pod opens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/8f6e28b36e519d7b34e7ff7ce6b39508.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/8f6e28b36e519d7b34e7ff7ce6b39508.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/8f6e28b36e519d7b34e7ff7ce6b39508.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Unit N94</strong>.<br>Two before you, <strong>N92</strong> and <strong>N93</strong>, left SUBY and never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first task: <strong>find their traces.</strong><br>Your real task: <strong>survive what took them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/5815c8ee6ccda849cbd00d4a6f15c75b.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/5815c8ee6ccda849cbd00d4a6f15c75b.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/5815c8ee6ccda849cbd00d4a6f15c75b.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into hostile radioactive complexes built by machines that outlived their masters. Expect brutal, fast-paced combat, analog weapons, corrupted AI guardians, robots cyborgs, and a world where every corner hides a threat or a forgotten truth where he ocean swallowed a large part of the world after the polar ice melted during the nuclear wars.<br><br>Fight to CTRL… but don’t SINK.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTRLSINK</strong> is a submerged post-apocalyptic retro-style FPS set after a devastating human/AI war. The world has drowned, the continents swallowed by rising oceans, and the last traces of humanity lie scattered in flooded bunkers and rusted war ruins. Blast through radioactive facilities, fight corrupted machines, and uncover the final secrets left beneath the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a9b682e718ab187cef8c10a7e7063278.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the Antarctic ice lies <strong>SUBY</strong> --&gt; an analog submarine fortress buried far below radiation zones, forgotten by the wars above. Inside it rests the last preserved humans, sleeping in cryogenic chambers for <strong>333 years</strong>, untouched by digital influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUBY is fully analog.<br>No uplink. No signal.<br>Only silence --&gt; until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.webm?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/a6471168adebfd2c75e6bfdb0ec52f9d.mp4?t=1787931544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries of isolation, <strong>Protocol CTRL</strong> has begun: the gradual awakening of the crew. Each revived human is immediately bonded to an <strong>Extreme Human Armor Suit</strong>, a relic of the pre-war era --&gt; no AI, purely biological-mechanical and analogical systems.<br>It heals. It strengthens. It protects. Is Controls.<br>It is the only thing keeping humanity alive outside SUBY’s hull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4209430/extras/e393ab0083f15d02ceb17b3b0ca5cdff.poster.avif?t=1787931544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"ht